{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "face26243b5a6dd4e530c9b305c6054d10a4f9acfe435666c21ee67d0ca56312", "ja": "（卒業生を劇場に招いて開催した\n『卒業生フリーライブ』公演が無事終了した）", "zh": "（邀请毕业生来到剧场举办的“毕业生自由演出”公演顺利结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1002_p", "source_sha256": "01d0820388d34924b98e42fc30b7daed99f118056ee8ff0b192fac7fba1efa7c", "ja": "のり子。卒業生のお見送りは終わったけど、\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "典子。毕业生的送别已经结束了，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "81a8abee300034244e4728a5ddb4a1b41665371e3c813d49d0b7e064f5986693", "ja": "あ……ううん。それが、最後の子を見送る時、\nすっごく嬉しいこと言われて。噛みしめてた！", "zh": "啊……没事。送最后一位毕业生离开的时候，\n她说了些特别让人开心的话。我正在回味呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1004_p", "source_sha256": "01d6386c5b0c701c973d70ac58d1411b56a23bf1f6e520f261712b2b70100e1f", "ja": "嬉しいこと？", "zh": "令人开心的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e8bd1b2489fec6f2e47f7d4f4bdc9081c8a7fa851e8021793736a54dad251b5", "ja": "「不登校で、卒業式に行く勇気がなかったけど、\n今日ここに来られてよかったです！」って。", "zh": "“虽然因为没去上学，没有勇气去毕业典礼，\n但今天能来这里真是太好了！”这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f50ad1d1244438fd11944d23d7d995489252158c38c3e27c795a2c89013e1dca", "ja": "おお、それは……この公演をやった甲斐があったな。", "zh": "哦，那还真是……这场公演办得很值得啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "13667c1a3d97cced16f7c8ce038d5963767c5f52b392de136870fc0247495d12", "ja": "うん！　あの番組に出られて、ほんとによかった。\nこの公演もね！", "zh": "嗯！能上那个节目，真是太好了。\n这次公演也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d6610659bcc8b1dc156af748d607a9b4ab7e4e67d447a2d7c6a002140775c20b", "ja": "ああ、みんなにも喜んでもらえたしな。\n目がキラキラして、輝いてて……。", "zh": "啊，大家也都很开心。\n眼睛闪闪发亮的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "bc8f6beb830a31262b1b2b30e5fe1370d57d4d07da7f17ebcb157d7dc4897dfc", "ja": "ほんとそうだったよね……。\nありがと、{$P$}。", "zh": "确实是这样呢……\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aac154f863fc1d1a3946108fbbdaef25e9c790c33a57b2c0aebf08132bc03adc", "ja": "？　俺は何もしていないよ。卒業生たちを\n笑顔にしたのは、のり子たちだ。", "zh": "？我什么都没做啊。是典子她们让毕业生们露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "13ef1ae71020c5ba9aa970bb48ef3104ef602c425f7ae1dc46656d091050b9b1", "ja": "表に出たのはたしかにアタシたちだけど……\nでも、支えてくれたじゃん。感謝してる！", "zh": "确实是我们站到了台前……但你不是也一直支持着我们吗？我很感谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1012_p", "source_sha256": "27d831cbb82403d6990de3722001aee1c8d5f37ba828e1c5c5a737cd7a489a31", "ja": "それは……当然のことだけど、\nそう言ってもらえるのは、ありがたいな。", "zh": "那是……当然的事，不过，\n能听到你这么说，我很感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "7124062aeab3c492aba58b0a36c4a758f3df4bf261956b7aba2f4e3aff982ba6", "ja": "こっちこそだよ！\nあ～、アタシってほんと、幸せ者だな。", "zh": "我才是要谢谢你！\n啊～我真是个幸福的人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "49927833f9ea4aafc48cd9e288d523b13e3e7f90cb58aae6d3dc25727682caf1", "ja": "まわりにいるのが、いい人ばっかりでさ。\nいやぁ、超ラッキーだよね♪", "zh": "周围全都是些大好人。\n哎呀～，我真是超级幸运呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1015_p", "source_sha256": "597240434ff9ffb9134d5cd9e55dad1622277dbd370db9dfec852a5a2d28ab00", "ja": "それは、のり子がそうさせてるんだと思うよ。\nのり子は周りを無理にでも明るくしてくれるから。", "zh": "我觉得，那是因为你才让大家变成这样的。因为你总是会想方设法让身边的人打起精神来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae66f785986ad4ef633e852b69d9ee361a7d84cfe7245c2a72ee551d4af1c0ca", "ja": "いやいや、それは褒めすぎだって～！　もう、\n照れるからネックブリーカードロップかけちゃうぞ！", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，夸得太过头啦～！真是的，\n人家会害羞的，小心我给你来个颈椎粉碎落哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0583_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "287c0550e3e89761eadfced4fe1c58278993a9ffdef565e60f6b41b0bd25a11a", "ja": "ん？　いや、ちょっと待った。\n……今、褒めてくれたってことでいいんだよね？", "zh": "嗯？不对，等等。\n……刚才那算是在夸我，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
